#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:6
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:8
msgid ""
"Scrapy keeps track of the cookies that websites set and sends them back on "
"later requests to those websites, just like a web browser does. That is the "
"job of :class:`~scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.cookies.CookiesMiddleware`, "
"which is enabled by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:15
msgid "Setting cookies on a request"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:21
msgid ""
"Use the ``cookies`` parameter of :class:`~scrapy.Request` to send cookies of "
"your own, either as a dict:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:24
msgid ""
"request = Request(\n"
"    url=\"https://example.com\",\n"
"    cookies={\"currency\": \"USD\", \"country\": \"UY\"},\n"
")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:31
msgid "Or as a list of dicts, which also lets you set cookie attributes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:33
msgid ""
"request = Request(\n"
"    url=\"https://example.com\",\n"
"    cookies=[\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"name\": \"currency\",\n"
"            \"value\": \"USD\",\n"
"            \"domain\": \"example.com\",\n"
"            \"path\": \"/currency\",\n"
"            \"secure\": True,\n"
"        },\n"
"    ],\n"
")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:48
msgid ""
"Setting attributes is only useful if the cookies are stored for later "
"requests, i.e. if :reqmeta:`dont_merge_cookies` is not enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:51
msgid ""
"Cookies set through the ``Cookie`` header are not handled by :class:`~scrapy."
"downloadermiddlewares.cookies.CookiesMiddleware`, which drops that header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:55
msgid ""
"When a cookie name or value is a byte sequence that is not UTF-8 encoded, "
"the cookie is dropped and a warning is logged. See :ref:`topics-logging-"
"advanced-customization` to customize the logging behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:64
msgid "Multiple cookie sessions per spider"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:66
msgid ""
"By default all requests share a single cookie jar (session). To use "
"different ones, pass an identifier in the :reqmeta:`cookiejar` request meta "
"key:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:70
msgid ""
"for i, url in enumerate(urls):\n"
"    yield Request(url, meta={\"cookiejar\": i}, callback=self.parse_page)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:75
msgid ""
"The :reqmeta:`cookiejar` meta key is not \"sticky\", so you need to keep "
"passing it along on subsequent requests:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:78
msgid ""
"def parse_page(self, response):\n"
"    return Request(\n"
"        \"https://example.com/otherpage\",\n"
"        meta={\"cookiejar\": response.meta[\"cookiejar\"]},\n"
"        callback=self.parse_other_page,\n"
"    )"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:91
msgid "Skipping the cookie jar for a request"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:93
msgid ""
"Set the :reqmeta:`dont_merge_cookies` request meta key to ``True`` to keep a "
"request from touching the cookie jar in either direction: no stored cookie "
"is sent with the request, and no cookie received in the response is stored. "
"The cookies of the request itself are ignored as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:102
msgid "COOKIES_ENABLED"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:104
msgid "Default: ``True``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:106
msgid ""
"Whether to enable :class:`~scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.cookies."
"CookiesMiddleware`. If disabled, no cookies are sent to web servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:113
msgid "COOKIES_DEBUG"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:115
msgid "Default: ``False``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:117
msgid ""
"If enabled, Scrapy logs all cookies sent in requests (i.e. the ``Cookie`` "
"header) and all cookies received in responses (i.e. the ``Set-Cookie`` "
"header)::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../topics/cookies.rst:121
msgid ""
"2011-04-06 14:35:10-0300 [scrapy.core.engine] INFO: Spider opened\n"
"2011-04-06 14:35:10-0300 [scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.cookies] DEBUG: "
"Sending cookies to: <GET http://www.diningcity.com/netherlands/index.html>\n"
"        Cookie: clientlanguage_nl=en_EN\n"
"2011-04-06 14:35:14-0300 [scrapy.downloadermiddlewares.cookies] DEBUG: "
"Received cookies from: <200 http://www.diningcity.com/netherlands/index."
"html>\n"
"        Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=B~FA4DC0C496C8762AE4F1A620EAB34F38; Path=/\n"
"        Set-Cookie: ip_isocode=US\n"
"        Set-Cookie: clientlanguage_nl=en_EN; Expires=Thu, 07-Apr-2011 "
"21:21:34 GMT; Path=/\n"
"2011-04-06 14:49:50-0300 [scrapy.core.engine] DEBUG: Crawled (200) <GET "
"http://www.diningcity.com/netherlands/index.html> (referer: None)\n"
"[...]"
msgstr ""

